<title>USA: EDITEK Inc Q4 shr loss narrows.</title>
<headline>EDITEK Inc Q4 shr loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>BURLINGTON, N.C. 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in thousands except per share amounts)</p>
<p>	    Year Ended December 31	  1996 (a)	  1995</p>
<p> Revenues				    $    26,726     $  7,526</p>
<p> Costs and Expenses			     39,535	 14,811</p>
<p>     Net Loss				(12,809)(b)	(7,285)</p>
<p> Loss Per Share of Common Stock	     (0.38)	 (0.77)</p>
<p>  Avg No of Shrs Outstanding	    33,455,867    9,445,707</p>
<p>(a) Includes the operating results of MEDTOX from January 30, 1996 to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(b) Includes write-offs of goodwill of $6,117,000 and restructuring costs of $2,449,000.</p>
<p>	Three Months Ended December 31    1996 (a)	  1995</p>
<p> Revenues				    $     6,602   $    1,863</p>
<p> Costs and Expenses			     14,937	  6,358</p>
<p>	Net Loss				(8,335)(b)	(4,495)</p>
<p> Loss Per Share of Common Stock	     (0.18)	 (0.45)</p>
<p> Avg No of Shrs Outstanding	     45,395,835    9,919,441</p>
<p>(a) Includes oper results of MEDTOX Jan 30 - Dec 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(b) Includes write-offs of goodwill of $6,016,000 and restructuring costs of $483,000.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1700</p>
</text>
